{"title":"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Ten_Variables)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Ten Variables)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(One_Variable)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (One Variable)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ten people form a circle.  Each picks a number and tells it to the two neighbors adjacent to them in the circle.  Then each person computes and announces the average of the numbers of their two neighbors. The figure shows the average announced by each person (<i>not</i> the original number the person picked.)\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98be29c93898c95b0899568da0199b09a9267f11.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(2 cm);  for(int i = 1; i &lt;= 10; ++i) {   label(&quot;``&quot; + (string) i + &quot;&amp;#039;&amp;#039;&quot;, dir(90 - 360/10*(i - 1))); } [/asy]\" width=\"215\" height=\"208\" />\nThe number picked by the person who announced the average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> was\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/4/9c4e9c52927f6e7d5c1b6caf61428c8571c16fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) } 5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) } 6 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) } 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{not uniquely determined from the given information}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"734\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Ten_Variables.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Ten_Variables)\">Solution 1 (Ten Variables)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Ten Variables)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f29bbe941fade3e23fda0ba638ad28007541ac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\in\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,10\\},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" /> suppose Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> picks the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and announces the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97f9c98bedd8b1bba471c213261407511ab9a65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i.$\" width=\"10\" height=\"12\" /> We wish to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec0b557b501131e75491cce9d4ca3d281f193786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>Taking the indices modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/517151f6f181bc7bcbfe164ac5c211c84abc0e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa5d12cca9cd12bf7999492f3378db7f13343a58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}}{2}=i,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"37\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/3/b83b64ba252800a57a66e5bf14d5bad1b2b0b297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}=2i.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We have ten equations: five with odd-numbered indices and five with even-numbered indices. Note that these two sets of equations are independent. The set that involves <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/a/34ace040475607683853fcfd4960a8f7fa6678c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a811e059284a0aa992d08dac9f7a5962d1d6339d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a_2 + a_4 &amp; = 6, &amp;&amp;(1) \\\\ a_4 + a_6 &amp; = 10, &amp;&amp;(2) \\\\ a_6 + a_8 &amp; = 14, &amp;&amp;(3) \\\\ a_8 + a_{10} &amp; = 18, &amp;&amp;(4) \\\\ a_{10} + a_2 &amp; = 2. &amp;&amp;(5) \\end{align*}\" width=\"267\" height=\"117\" />\nSumming these five equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/00335c112ff8e4abd59eb0a5fd1524dda9e4dc20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(a_2 + a_4 + a_6 + a_8 + a_{10}) = 50,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"253\" height=\"20\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d10b680a12d768cca8cc81dd988fdb831224c0c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_2 + a_4 + a_6 + a_8 + a_{10} = 25. \\hspace{15mm} (\\bigstar)\\]\" width=\"328\" height=\"18\" />\nSubtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59f34f6f800764db09a7fac300fc5414463766ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)+(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458f4c22e3fa988062d6b0856b2d421bf939f7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\bigstar),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62ea9666c3316705149df5ab967a33dbfc14b7e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_6=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"104\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Misof (Solution)\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM (Revision)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28One_Variable.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(One_Variable)\">Solution 2 (One Variable)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (One Variable)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/2/9f29bbe941fade3e23fda0ba638ad28007541ac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\in\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,10\\},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" /> suppose Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> announces the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97f9c98bedd8b1bba471c213261407511ab9a65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i.$\" width=\"10\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number picked by Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de3ed5fb7fa9b1fa73395d65c43e5bc81cd9d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> We construct the following table:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da456671b546064e9d4cce330c35357da88a50c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c||l} &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2.5ex] \\textbf{People} &amp; \\textbf{Average of \\#s Picked} &amp; \\textbf{Sum of \\#s Picked} &amp; \\multicolumn{1}{c}{\\textbf{Conclusion}} \\\\ [0.5ex] \\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2ex] 6\\text{ and }8 &amp; 7 &amp; 14 &amp; \\text{Person 8 picks } 14-x. \\\\ 8\\text{ and }10 &amp; 9 &amp; 18 &amp; \\text{Person 10 picks } 4+x. \\\\ 10\\text{ and }2 &amp; 1 &amp; 2 &amp; \\text{Person 2 picks } -2-x \\\\ 2\\text{ and }4 &amp; 3 &amp; 6 &amp; \\text{Person 4 picks } 8+x \\\\ 4\\text{ and }6 &amp; 5 &amp; 10 &amp; \\text{Person 6 picks } 2-x \\\\ \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"640\" height=\"131\" />\nWe have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c625192f6ec4541923892b6dbaaeeb58cbe00d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2-x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" /> from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/a/6fa0a57920946fb73b5cffed8add5d70e82f59a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 1}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"98\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cqtr_OgZ3Xg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cqtr_OgZ3Xg</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KlRSJ09uPHc\">https://youtu.be/KlRSJ09uPHc</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME\" title=\"1990 AHSME\">1990 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_A